### API Layer (`src/lib/readiness/`)
- **[NEW] [api.ts](file:///c:/Users/SaudShaikh/transvolt%20data/fleet-insights-pro/src/lib/readiness/api.ts)**: Define all `fetch` wrappers for the Site Readiness endpoints (Checklist CRUD, Matrix, Overdue, Due Soon, Pending, Stats, Config, and Snapshots).
- **[NEW] [queries.ts](file:///c:/Users/SaudShaikh/transvolt%20data/fleet-insights-pro/src/lib/readiness/queries.ts)**: Create `@tanstack/react-query` hooks (`useQuery`, `useMutation`) wrapping the API calls to handle caching, loading states, error handling, and data invalidation.
